35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"I found the transport receipts! Going far costs 38% of the budget, staying local only 9%. Also, whole-building lets mean we pay for late cancellations.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The seniors say mixing only happens when we sleep together. But a fifth never came, and left by winter.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The hall is booked by three other clubs. Training would be split into early mornings and late evenings. Cooking duty is gone, but the schedule is broken.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,Eight people in one room! And lights out at eleven? That sounds like a nightmare. I want to sleep properly to train hard!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The transport receipts show distance drives the cost. Inland trips also mean eight to a room. I need to know if that deficit is sustainable.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
